msgid "GNOME Remote Desktop"
msgstr "GNOME Remote Desktop"

msgid "Mote"
msgstr "Mote"

msgid "Remote Desktop Client"
msgstr "Client per desktop remoto"

msgid "Connect to Linux desktops over RDP and VNC"
msgstr "Connettiti a desktop Linux tramite RDP e VNC"

msgid "RDP;VNC;Remote Desktop;xrdp;TigerVNC;"
msgstr "RDP;VNC;Remote Desktop;Desktop remoto;xrdp;TigerVNC;"

msgid ""
"Mote is a remote desktop client for GNOME specifically designed to connect "
"to Linux desktops over RDP and VNC. Supported implementations include GNOME "
"Remote Desktop (including Remote Login), xrdp, KRdp, TigerVNC and wayvnc."
msgstr ""
"Mote è un client per desktop remoto per GNOME, progettato specificamente per "
"connettersi a desktop Linux tramite RDP e VNC. Le implementazioni supportate "
"includono GNOME Remote Desktop (compreso l’Accesso remoto), xrdp, KRdp, "
"TigerVNC e wayvnc."

msgid ""
"Designed and tested for full compatibility with GNOME Remote Desktop (and "
"Remote Login), xrdp and KRdp"
msgstr ""
"Progettato e testato per la piena compatibilità con GNOME Remote Desktop (e "
"l’Accesso remoto), xrdp e KRdp"

msgid ""
"Dynamic resolution resizing for supported sessions including seamless HiDPI "
"support"
msgstr ""
"Ridimensionamento dinamico della risoluzione per le sessioni supportate, con "
"supporto HiDPI trasparente"

msgid "H.264 video encoding with RemoteFX fallback"
msgstr "Codifica video H.264 con RemoteFX come alternativa"

msgid "Multi-monitor support"
msgstr "Supporto multi-monitor"

msgid "Full clipboard sharing between host and remote machines"
msgstr "Condivisione completa degli appunti tra macchina locale e remota"

msgid ""
"VNC with RSA-AES, VeNCrypt and TLS encryption, resizing and clipboard sharing"
msgstr ""
"VNC con cifratura RSA-AES, VeNCrypt e TLS, ridimensionamento e condivisione "
"degli appunti"

msgid "SSH tunnels and RD gateway support"
msgstr "Supporto per tunnel SSH e RD Gateway"

msgid "Wake-on-LAN support with built-in fault tolerance"
msgstr "Supporto Wake-on-LAN con tolleranza ai guasti integrata"

msgid "Sound, microphone and folder sharing with supported remote sessions"
msgstr ""
"Condivisione di audio, microfono e cartelle con le sessioni remote supportate"

msgid ""
"Import existing RDP and VNC files directly into the app or import from "
"Remmina"
msgstr ""
"Importa file RDP e VNC esistenti direttamente nell’app o importa da Remmina"

msgid "A session beside the saved connections"
msgstr "Una sessione accanto alle connessioni salvate"

